W: 2. And now that we've drunk to our master's health,
W: Why should our mistress go free?
W: Why shouldn't she go to heaven,
W: To heaven as well as he?
W: She is a good provider,
W: Abroad as well as at home.
W: So fill your cup, and drink it all up,
W: For this is the harvest home.
W:
W: [Chorus:]
W: So, drink, boys, drink,
